      "text": [
        "UPPER TERRACE. Quarry works, and the Stone Hall above them.",
        "Hard hats past the weighbridge. Children off the sleepers.",
        "Underneath, in chalk: OR ELSE WHAT"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 26,
      "y": 50,
      "text": [
        "STONEWAKE. Nine thousand four hundred souls and one mountain.",
        "South: Route 2, and Briarbell beyond it.",
        "East: Kerb Street, and the coast road after that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 34,
      "text": [
        "KERB STREET. Museum and Foundation north. Market south.",
        "A second board lists eleven lodging houses. Nine are full."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 12,
      "text": [
        "THE WEST WORKING IS STOPPED.",
        "By order of the Company, and of Keeper Quill, who does not work here",
        "and put her name on it anyway."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7,
      "text": [
        "THE STONE HALL. Terra. Keeper Roxen Quill.",
        "Challengers go down, not in. Bring a lamp, and better boots than those."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 27,
      "text": [
        "THE STONEWAKE MUSEUM.",
        "Stone, bones, and the people who were here first.",
        "Free on the first day of the month. There is a queue on the first of the month."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 13,
      "y": 27,
      "text": [
        "THE MERIDIAN FOUNDATION - Stonewake Field Office.",
        "Weather stations. Ocean survey. Kin conservation. Disaster relief.",
        "The brass is polished. Somebody polishes it every morning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 14,
      "y": 33,
      "text": [
        "STONEWAKE PROVISIONER. Trade prices for anyone with quarry dust on them.",
        "Everyone in Stonewake has quarry dust on them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 14,
      "y": 39,
      "text": [
        "KIN CLINIC. Open, always.",
        "The night bell is on the left. Please do not ring it about a graze."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 22,
      "y": 38,
      "text": [
        "THE GREEN. The only soft ground inside the city.",
        "Planted the year the tramway went in, by a foreman who said Stonewake",
        "needed somewhere to look at that was not grey."
      ]
    },
